        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Publications: Adventist World, Girls' Life\n- People: Ángel Manuel Rodríguez, Carol Weston\n- Places: Silver Spring, Maryland; Seoul, Korea; Baltimore, Maryland\n- Roles: editors, advice columnist, monthly columnist, author\n\nFacts:\n- Since Girls' Life first issue in 1994, Carol Weston has served as the magazine's \"Dear Carol\" advice columnist.\n- Carol Weston is the author of sixteen books in fiction and non-fiction.\n- Adventist World editors are based in Silver Spring, Maryland and Seoul, Korea.\n- Girls' Life is headquartered in Baltimore, Maryland.\n- Ángel Manuel Rodríguez has written several books.\n- Ángel Manuel Rodríguez authors a monthly column in Adventist World.",
